WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.900
 [MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.920
 The definition of a peptide refers

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:14.520
 to a structure formed by the combination

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:19.480
 of different amino acids, which together is called a peptide.

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:21.360
 When multiple peptides aggregate together,

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:24.520
 they can form a protein.

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:26.400
 We spend a large amount of money screening

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:29.480
 over 1,000 specific peptide sequences

00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:33.560
 to confirm those with specific functions.

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:38.440
 We discovered that this peptide can repair human optic nerves.

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:41.040
 By adding peptides to specific areas,

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:45.720
 it can maintain relative humidity for eight hours, which

00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:48.520
 can accelerate wound healing and repair damage

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:51.280
 from dry eye syndrome.

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:53.720
 Therefore, we have introduced this product

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:56.960
 in the form of a specific sequence peptide spray

00:00:56.960 --> 00:01:00.440
 to benefit our compatriots suffering from dry eye syndrome.

00:01:00.440 --> 00:01:13.400
 [MUSIC PLAYING]

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:17.400
 It took us about 10 years of observation to complete,

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:21.800
 and now we have screened several specific sequence

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:26.200
 peptides with different functions.

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:29.040
 After discovering this peptide from DIGA,

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:32.080
 it can induce the production of our own VEGF,

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:34.680
 which is the release of vascular endothelial growth

00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:36.080
 factor.

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:40.680
 Using this method, it accelerates wound healing.

00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:46.440
 This peptide is indeed an extremely tiny protein peptide.

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:48.160
 The results of our tests show that it

00:01:48.160 --> 00:01:51.440
 has a very good effect on enhancing skin elasticity

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:52.560
 and moisture retention.

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:58.620
 (soft music)
